{
  "slug": "easing-wizard",
  "name": "Easing Wizard",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Generate professional CSS easing curves, audit animations, and get expert motion design advice — powered by Easing Wizard",
  "longDescription": "Ships **4 skills**, **1 agent**, **1 hook** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (4): `audit-easings` (Scan the entire project for animations using default or missing easings and produce a prioritized improvement report), `easing-advice` (Suggests professional easing curves when writing or editing CSS transitions, animations, or Tailwind motion utilities), `improve-easings` (Add or improve easing curves in specific CSS or Tailwind files), `recommend-curve` (Recommend an easing curve for a specific animation feel or UI pattern)\n- **Agents** (1): `animation-expert` (Animation and easing specialist with deep knowledge of motion design principles and perceptual psychology)\n- **Hooks** (1): `SessionStart`\n- **MCP servers** (1): `easingwizard`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install easing-wizard@claude-community` from `roydigerhund/easingwizard-claude-plugin`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 4,
    "agent": 1,
    "hook": 1,
    "mcp": 1
  },
